      "text": "static keyword is used in three places in java\n\n1. static data/variable\n\n2. static method\n\n3. static blocks",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "static keyword is used in three places in java\n\n1. static data/variable\n\n2. static method\n\n3. static blocks",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
