      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785487553368,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "**Class Loading (Runtime)\n\nThe JVM loads the class when it is first actively used.\n\nThis happens when:\n\n✅ new Demo()\n✅ Demo.staticVariable\n✅ Demo.staticMethod()\n✅ Class.forName(\"Demo\")\n✅ Running java Demo (calls main())",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "**Class Loading (Runtime)\n\nThe JVM loads the class when it is first actively used.\n\nThis happens when:\n\n✅ new Demo()\n✅ Demo.staticVariable\n✅ Demo.staticMethod()\n✅ Class.forName(\"Demo\")\n✅ Running java Demo (calls main())",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
